        "text": "If *ensure_ascii* is true (the default), the output is guaranteed to have all incoming non-ASCII and non-printable characters escaped. If *ensure_ascii* is false, all characters will be output as-is, except for the characters that must be escaped: quotation mark, reverse solidus, and the control characters U+0000 through U+001F.",
