        "score": 0.5120772557102613,
        "section": "json",
        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 153,
        "text": "As permitted, though not required, by the RFC, this module's serializer sets *ensure_ascii=True* by default, thus escaping the output so that the resulting strings only contain printable ASCII characters.",
        "title": "json"
      },
      {
        "end": 352,
        "estimated_tokens": 51,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "page_id": 8,
        "position": 2,
        "record_id": "53a7154eabc3c72a8b34ba0b",
        "score": 0.505257987631132,
        "section": "3.5",
        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 198,
        "text": "The \"json.dumps()\" function was optimized to run with \"ensure_ascii=False\" as fast as with \"ensure_ascii=True\". (Contributed by Naoki Inada in bpo-23206.)",
        "title": "3.5"
      },
      {
        "end": 543,
